      "content": "<p>Let the number of elements in sets <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.697ex\" height=\"1.62ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 750 716\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D434\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D434\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.717ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 759 683\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> be five and two respectively. Then the number of subsets of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.18ex\" height=\"1.62ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 2731.4 716\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D434\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D434\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(972.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1972.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> each having at least 3 and at most 6 elements is :</p>",
